{"unit_id": "tag:0AG5:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为分次环（graded ring），且<MATH_0002>是拟紧（quasi-compact）的。设<MATH_0003>为拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的<MATH_0004>模（module）。将<MATH_0005>视为分次（graded）<MATH_0006>模（module），见《Constructions》第<REF_0001>节。映射（map）<MATH_0007>（见《Constructions》中的引理<REF_0002>）是同构（isomorphism）。若<MATH_0008>由标准开集（standard opens）<MATH_0009>覆盖，其中<MATH_0010>的次数（degree）为<MATH_0011>，则所诱导（induced）的映射（maps）<MATH_0012>均为恒等（identity）映射（maps）。\n", "allowed_english": ["Constructions"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "standard opens", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "次数"}, {"source_term": "induced", "target_term": "诱导"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "identity", "target_term": "恒等"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环", "context": "引理所设的环带有分次。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "引理对相应空间的拟紧性假设。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "修饰引理所设的模。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "第一次出现，指引理所设的拟凝聚模。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "修饰赋予所得模的分次结构。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "第二次出现，指按分次结构看待的模。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所引引理给出的映射。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "说明所引引理给出的映射是同构。"}, {"source_term": "standard opens", "target_term": "标准开集", "context": "指用于给出覆盖的标准开集。"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "次数", "context": "指确定标准开集的元素的次数。"}, {"source_term": "induced", "target_term": "诱导", "context": "修饰结尾断言中的映射。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "第一次出现，指所诱导的一组映射。"}, {"source_term": "identity", "target_term": "恒等", "context": "指结尾断言中映射的恒等性质。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "第二次出现，与“恒等”构成术语。"}], "notes": []}
